  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing food and nutrition security in the Southern Province of Rwanda.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the action is &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;to promote food and nutrition security and food systems resilience in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Gisagara and Nyaruguru districts, which will be achieved through the following specific objectives/outcomes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;OS 1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Increased adoption of sustainable food production practices for smallholder farmers Gisagara and Nyaruguru districts,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;OS2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Improved productivity and incomes for smallholder farmers including women-led and men-led SHGs (Self-Help Groups) and cooperatives,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;OS 3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Improved dietary intake among small-holder farmers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The following outputs will contribute to the achievement of the above objectives;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Output 1.1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Increased capacities of small holders on GAP (good agricultural practices) and sustainable agricultural management practices,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Output 1.2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Strengthened capacity of the smallholder farmers on post-harvest management practices, value addition and post-harvesting technologies,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Output 2.1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Increased availability of financial means and services for businesses (including women and/or youth led entities) active in innovative and sustainable agriculture,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Output 2.2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;: Strengthened capacity of smallholder farmers from SHGs and cooperatives on business activities, enterprise development and investment skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Output 3.1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;Increased knowledge of smallholder farmers on nutrition-sensitive agriculture practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
